spans.s:
उत॑ (indecl.) and, also, even;
 अप्युत and also;
 उत-उत
(also उतो) as well-as, both-and. As interr. particle or in the sec.
part of a double interrogation, often w. वा, आहो, स्विद् & आहो स्विद् or
also, or even. — Cf. उ & किम्.

{#{{u/tTaBita->u/ttaBita||20160418|Jim Funderburk|https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/289|cf MW;
 alphabetical order ;
 variant of uttabDa}}#} a. erected, set up.

उत्तम॑ (superl.) upmost, highest, first or best of (—˚);
chief, excellent;
 extreme, last;
 better than, superior to (abl.);
 m. the
first person (g.).

उ॑त्तर (compar.) upper, higher;
 northern, left (opp.
द॑क्षिण);
 later, following, subsequent, future, last;
 being above,
victorious, superior, mightier, better. n. surface, cover (mostly adj.
—˚ covered with);
 the north. hinder or last part, sequel, consequence
(—˚ followed by);
 answer, reply;
 defence, rejoinder (j.);
 superiority,
victory, power of (loc. of an abstr.);
 chief part of characteristic;
excess, surplus (only adj. —˚).

उत्त॑रण a. crossing, passing, over;
 n. the same as
subst., overcoming (—˚).

उत्तारण a. saving (Śiva);
 n. bringing over (—˚),
delivering from (abl.).

उत्तरत॑स् adv. northward, from north, north or left of
(gen.);
 further.

उत्तरपक्ष m. the northern or left wing (side);
 reply
to an objection, refutation (ph.).

उत्तराधर॑ a. higher and lower;
 n. the upper and
under lip, the lips.

उत्तरार्ध॑ m. the upper part (esp. of the body);
 the
northern part, the latter half.

उत्तान॑ a. stretched out (lying);
 turned upwards, high,
straight, upright;
 being on the surface, open, shallow.

उत्ताल a. vehement, violent;
 huge, dreadful;
 abundant,
copious.
